  /// specified for an instance type, it is set to the default value "1". For
  /// more information about capacity weighting, see Instance Weighting for
  /// Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling in the Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide.
  pub instance_definitions: List[InstanceDefinition]? = None
  /// Configuration settings to define a scaling policy for the Auto Scaling
