  /// gameSessionProperties , maximumSessions , creationTimeMillis ,
  /// playerSessionCount , hasAvailablePlayerSessions . Order -- Valid sort
  /// orders are ASC (ascending) and DESC (descending). For example, this sort
  /// expression returns the oldest active sessions first: "SortExpression":
