  /// ::gamesessionqueue/ . Queues can be located in any Region. Queues are
  /// used to start new Amazon GameLift Servers-hosted game sessions for
  /// matches that are created with this matchmaking configuration. A
  /// matchmaking configuration supports only one queue; if you specify more
  /// than one ARN, the request fails with an InvalidRequestException . If
  /// FlexMatchMode is set to STANDALONE , do not set this parameter.
